---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import CustomerDiagram from '../components/CustomerDiagram.astro';
import IndustryIcon from '../components/IndustryIcon.astro';
import industries from '../data/industries.json';
import { GUIDE_RATE } from '../data/consultancy.js';
---
<SiteLayout title="Agenquest | AEO Strategy and Execution" description="Help the right customers discover your business through AI. Customer research, tailored AEO strategy, and execution. Start with a free 30-minute call.">
<section class="hero hero-simple"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">AEO strategy and execution</p>
<h1>Get in, friend. Let's get you clients through AEO.</h1>
<p>We help businesses get discovered and considered in AI answers. We start with your customers, find where your business is missing or misunderstood, and build a tailored plan across your website, content, reviews, and third-party coverage.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-help/">See how we help →</a></p>
<p>Free 30-minute call. Initial findings and a plan to discuss. No commitment.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section industry-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Different businesses. Real buying decisions.</h2>
<p>A customer choosing software, a family comparing mortgage providers, or a shopper researching skincare can all bring their questions to AI. The useful AEO work depends on who is asking, what they need, and what would make your business a credible choice.</p>
<p><a class="text-link" href="/who-aeo-is-for/">See who AEO is for →</a></p></div><div class="rail-controls" hidden><button class="icon-button" id="industry-prev" aria-label="Previous industries">←</button><button class="icon-button" id="industry-next" aria-label="Next industries">→</button></div></div><div class="industry-rail" id="industry-rail">{industries.map(industry=><a class="industry-tile" href={`/who-aeo-is-for/#${industry.id}`}><IndustryIcon name={industry.id}/><span>{industry.title}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div><p class="small">Examples of where AEO may be useful, not a list of our clients.</p></div></section>
<section class="section context-section" id="shift"><div class="container split"><div><h2>Your customers don't think in keywords.</h2>
<p>They have a situation, a budget, and reasons to hesitate. We combine keyword research with customer feedback, interviews, and surveys where needed to understand how they choose. Yes, we like a useful survey.</p></div><aside class="buyer-question"><p class="eyebrow">Illustrative buyer question</p><blockquote>“Which reporting tool fits a five-person team, a modest budget, and no full-time administrator?”</blockquote></aside></div></section>
<section class="section" id="services"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><h2>A plan built around your customers.</h2>
<p>We turn customer insight into priorities, then help put the plan into practice across your content, technical foundations, and outside evidence.</p>
</div><div id="signals"><CustomerDiagram /></div><div class="four-columns">
<div><h3>Understand your customers</h3>
<p>Map what starts a customer's search, what they compare, and what gives them confidence to choose.</p></div><div><h3>Find the gaps</h3>
<p>Test realistic buying questions and check where your business is missing, misunderstood, or passed over for an alternative.</p></div><div><h3>Improve what people can find</h3>
<p>Build AEO, SEO, and human-optimized content, fix technical issues, and strengthen genuine reviews and outside evidence.</p></div><div><h3>Measure what matters</h3>
<p>Review visibility alongside inquiries and available business outcomes, then use what we learn to set the next priorities.</p></div></div><p><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-help/">Explore the work in detail →</a></p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="research"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><h2>See how we think before we talk.</h2>
<p>Our independent brand teardowns show what we would investigate and change if we were hired. They include the questions we tested, what we observed, and where the evidence stops.</p>
</div><div class="research-grid"><a class="research-card" href="/blog/improving-our-place-aeo/"><span class="eyebrow">Independent analysis / 01</span><h3>Our Place</h3><p>Where cookware recommendations include the brand, where they miss it, and what we would investigate next.</p><span class="text-link">Read the analysis →</span></a><a class="research-card" href="/blog/improving-material-kitchen-aeo/"><span class="eyebrow">Independent analysis / 02</span><h3>Material Kitchen</h3><p>What we would change to make the brand’s strengths easier to discover and evaluate.</p><span class="text-link">Read the analysis →</span></a><a class="research-card" href="/blog/improving-tower-28-aeo/"><span class="eyebrow">Independent analysis / 03</span><h3>Tower 28</h3><p>How we would connect its sensitive-skin proposition to more relevant buying situations.</p><span class="text-link">Read the analysis →</span></a></div><div class="section-tail"><p class="small">Independent analyses. These brands are not Agenquest clients.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Browse all research →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section founder-section"><div class="container split"><div><h2>You'll work with Rishav and Anuj.</h2>
<p>We're the founders of Agenquest. We bring backgrounds in strategy, analytics, and financial software, and a shared interest in how AI is changing the way people discover and choose businesses.</p>
<p>We're building this closely with our early clients. You'll speak directly with us about the problem, the priorities, and the work.</p>
<p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet the founders →</a></p></div><div class="founder-names"><div><span class="eyebrow">Co-founder</span><h3>Rishav Jain</h3><p>Strategy and analytics</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Co-founder</span><h3>Anuj Kumar Sinha</h3><p>Financial software and implementation</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section invitation"><div class="container invitation-inner"><h2>We're early. You can help shape what comes next.</h2>
<p>We're looking for our next clients: businesses with something worth choosing and an interest in understanding how AI could help the right customers find them.</p>
<p>We'll start with a free 30-minute call and an initial AEO plan for your business. If there's a fit, we'll agree the work and price before we begin.</p>
<p>Our current guide rate is around <strong>{GUIDE_RATE}</strong>. Your total depends on the scope, and we'll share an estimate first.</p>
<p>We offer exclusivity within your agreed niche. We'll define the boundaries together before the engagement starts.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="faq"><div class="container faq-wrap"><h2>A few things you might want to know.</h2>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What is AEO?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Answer Engine Optimization is work to help a business get accurately represented, cited, or recommended in AI answers. It overlaps with SEO, useful content, public reputation, and independent evidence.</p></div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What happens on the free call?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>We review your public website before the call, then discuss initial findings, your customers, and a working plan for where AEO could help. It's a 30-minute conversation, not a full audit or a commitment to paid work.</p></div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>How much does the work cost?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>The initial call is free. Our current guide rate is around {GUIDE_RATE}. We agree the deliverables and an estimate before paid work begins. Any third-party costs are discussed separately before you incur them.</p></div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Can you guarantee recommendations or new clients?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. AI answers vary, and we don't control the platforms or your customers' decisions. We can commit to a clear plan, agreed work, and transparent reporting.</p></div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Is this only for large consumer brands?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. We consider businesses across sectors and sizes. The important questions are whether AI could influence a valuable buying decision and whether there is useful work we can do.</p></div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Can we work together as partners?</summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. If you're an agency, consultant, or service provider, tell us where you think we could work together through the contact form.</p></div></details>
<h2 id="audit">Let's look at your business.</h2><p>Share your website. We'll prepare initial findings and arrange a free 30-minute conversation about what to do next.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
const rail=document.querySelector('#industry-rail');const prev=document.querySelector('#industry-prev');const next=document.querySelector('#industry-next');
if(rail instanceof HTMLElement && prev instanceof HTMLButtonElement && next instanceof HTMLButtonElement){
document.querySelector('.rail-controls')?.removeAttribute('hidden');
const update=()=>{prev.disabled=rail.scrollLeft<2;next.disabled=rail.scrollLeft+rail.clientWidth>=rail.scrollWidth-2;};
prev.addEventListener('click',()=>rail.scrollBy({left:-rail.clientWidth*.75,behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'}));
next.addEventListener('click',()=>rail.scrollBy({left:rail.clientWidth*.75,behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'}));
rail.addEventListener('scroll',update,{passive:true});new ResizeObserver(update).observe(rail);update();}
</script>
